WEBVTT

00:00:58.596 --> 00:01:02.391
there is a much more effective,
drug-free approach

00:01:02.391 --> 00:01:06.687
called Cognitive Behavioral
Therapy for Insomnia,

00:01:06.687 --> 00:01:08.648
or CBTI for short.

00:01:09.023 --> 00:01:12.235
And by working with a clinician
for several weeks --

00:01:12.235 --> 00:01:14.487
which you can do online, by the way --

00:01:14.487 --> 00:01:16.989
the therapy helps change your habits,

00:01:16.989 --> 00:01:18.199
your beliefs

00:01:18.199 --> 00:01:21.661
and your general stress
around this thing called sleep.

00:01:22.245 --> 00:01:23.913
And there are now many studies

00:01:23.913 --> 00:01:28.668
that have shown CBTI to be
just as effective as sleeping pills

00:01:28.668 --> 00:01:29.836
in the short term.

00:01:29.919 --> 00:01:33.631
Yet CBTI has no negative side effects,